text=text.replace('Retain H00011/H00020/H00021 as conditional pH improvements over the matched C00003-derived parent, not as experimentally established leads.', 'Retain H00011 and H00021 as conditional pH improvements over the matched C00003-derived parent, not as experimentally established leads. H00020 remains a human-pH hypothesis with a failed mouse peptide gate, not a fully geometry-passing candidate.')
